  "solution": "**Given:**\n\nPrincipal (P) = Rs. 9600\n\nAmount (A) = Rs. 11094\n\nRate (r) = 7.5%\n\n**Concept used:**\n\nA = P(1 + r/100)t\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n11094 = 9600(1 + 15/200)t\n\n⇒ 11094/9600 = (1 + 15/200)t\n\n⇒ 1849/1600 = (215/200)t\n\n⇒ (43/40)² = (43/40)t\n\n⇒ 2 = t\n\n**∴ Required time is 2 years**",
